            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hopf+constructions"} Hopf constructions
            on the four
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/normed+division+algebras"} normed division algebras
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#Adams60
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+F.+Adams"}> John F. Adams
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the non-existence of elements of Hopf invariant one
                %strong 72
                1 (1960) 20-104 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.jstor.org/stable/1970147"}> jstor:1970147
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Adams66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+F.+Adams"}> John F. Adams
                , Section 8 of:
                = succeed "," do
